Nautilus.Special.erf is callable at f64 from 0.7.47 but its A&S approximation
does not meet the observed accuracy of Shoals.Pricing.erf64 (Cody).

On pass: inspect the new primitive's numbered [05-OP-N] atom and numerical
accuracy; compare it against Shoals.Pricing.erf64 before replacing the kernel.
Promote this probe to tests/ as a positive test, remove the active chelis#902
narrowing only after the replacement meets the accuracy contract, and update
docs/CHELIS_SURFACE.md and docs/UPSTREAM_BUGS.md in the same change set.
